    "improves_backtest_mae": false,
    "note": "Worth saying plainly: this adjustment does not sharpen the backtest \u2014 walk-forward error moves from 6.719 to 7.169 wins, flat or worse. We keep it anyway, because matching the real 82-game season total and the real spread of win totals are correct on their own terms, independent of whether they happen to shave points off average error. Don't read this as \"calibration helped.\""
  },
  "feature_experiments": {
