      "result": "It does. Walk-forward error improved from 6.781 to 6.719 wins (GBM won both times) \u2014 a small but real, repeatable gain, not noise (KNN has no randomness here, and GBM's seed is fixed). We kept it: these projected features (avg_age_projected, avg_pts_top10_projected, avg_production_score_projected) are now part of the model, not just a side experiment. See backend/win_model/player_projection_features.py to re-run the check after touching the aging curve."
